# The CNI plugins the image carries: bridge, host-local and loopback, built from source at the
# commit that tag v1.9.1 of the public containernetworking/plugins repository is. The commit, not
# the tag, is the pin: build.sh fetches that object and fails unless HEAD is it, and a tag can be
# moved.
#
# Why this release (chosen 2026-11-13, from the repository's tags and its GitHub releases): the
# newest release at least two weeks old. v1.9.1 was published 2026-03-16. v1.10.0 was published
# 2026-11-09, four days before that date, so it is excluded.
#
# Moved by: the PM, in a pull request that reruns `make image` and `make image-repro` and the QEMU
# test that starts a Pod, when a release is at least two weeks old or an advisory is published for
# the pinned one. No bot proposes it.
CNI_REPO=https://github.com/containernetworking/plugins
CNI_VERSION=v1.9.1
CNI_COMMIT=adc3e6b5b581638afbd194cf2e9319ecbb0151a1
